(
    title: "Base Attack",
    description: Some("An inversion of the classic base-defence shooter: here you are the attacker. You fly a craft (a UFO on screen) over the landscape and bomb the enemy bases on the ground, steering in four directions and firing whichever way you move — with only one shot allowed in the air at a time. The bases shoot back at random, and some of their fire becomes a heat-seeking floating ball that hunts you down; take a hit or touch the ball and you lose one of your three craft."),
